on\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Playback and tool issues\\n\\n### Q: What if the player spins forever or never loads?\\nReport the task ID and available reproduction details as a tool incident. Do not score the recording as a model-quality failure while it cannot be evaluated.\\n\\n### Q: Can I use QN because playback is unavailable?\\nPlayback failure alone does not establish a content-based QN reason. Report the tool incident. If other accessible evidence raises a separate content concern, retain it for review rather than assuming what the unavailable audio contains.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790890099.000112:64d38d33\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"title\": \"Slack announcement in audio-multimodal-announcements at 2026-10-01T21:28:19.000112+00:00\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1790890099.000112\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1790890099.000112\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-10-01T21:28:19.000112+00:00\", \"basis\": \"created_at\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T21:28:19.000112+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_06\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"UNKNOWN\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT post