layback is unavailable.\\n- Capture the browser/error state and whether another clip plays. An old workaround must be checked against the current symptoms; recurrence alone does not establish which fix was tried or why it failed.\\n- Handling guidance does not confirm that playback has been repaired or that an affected task can be evaluated.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-playback-trial-post@1.0:d674dbe6\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"HISTORY_ONLY\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-playback-trial-post@1.0\", \"title\": \"Playback trial posted to audio announcements\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1787581200.700001\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1787581200.700001\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"channel_announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"created_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00.700001+00:00\", \"valid_until\": \"2026-08-28T21:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": true}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_05\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"other_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_slack_archive\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"posted\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: valid_until 2026-08-28T21:00:00Z has passed. May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\\nAudio batch 05: through Friday, August 28, try a